{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_28","type":"agent_message","text":"The project now compiles with the main fixes. I’m tightening the HTTP behavior and availability projection: stock conflicts must remain recognizable through the controller wrappers, and zero stock must force both `available` and `canBePurchased` false without overriding a merchant’s manual unavailability."}}
